 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/75c161aa11d713c9a8da32cca80adf4d.poster.avif?t=1782201614\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/75c161aa11d713c9a8da32cca80adf4d.webm?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/75c161aa11d713c9a8da32cca80adf4d.mp4?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive a Harsh World</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each layer brings its own challenges, adapt and descend. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simulated Limb and Cardiovascular Systems</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Injuries are unavoidable. You will have to bandage yourself, fight infected wounds, and stabilize blood loss before losing consciousness. Additionally, your mood can greatly affect your chances of survival, too much doom and gloom will make your life harder. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/b3884ced84ba6d0a433d7dbdf284ab71.poster.avif?t=1782201614\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/b3884ced84ba6d0a433d7dbdf284ab71.webm?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/b3884ced84ba6d0a433d7dbdf284ab71.mp4?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft to Survive</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a creature capable of reason, using tools will allow you to travel the cavernous layers more efficiently. In case you start bleeding out, the flora will provide great resources to patch yourself up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore at Your Own Risk</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Previous expeditions have left some good loot behind. But even helpful things can prove to be your death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What actually lies at the end of this journey? And what becomes of you if you are to succeed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/4fcbd793385f447abfaf27a4750ea84c.poster.avif?t=1782201614\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/4fcbd793385f447abfaf27a4750ea84c.webm?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/4fcbd793385f447abfaf27a4750ea84c.mp4?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An entirely simulated cardiovascular and limb damage system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character traits to increase on your run: Intelligence, Strength, and Resilience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robust crafting mechanics to increase your odds of survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 characters with their own distinct playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 layers of an alien planet with their own challenges and dangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300 items to find on your runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable loot and danger values accessible on the main menu</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/75c161aa11d713c9a8da32cca80adf4d.poster.avif?t=1782201614\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/75c161aa11d713c9a8da32cca80adf4d.webm?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/75c161aa11d713c9a8da32cca80adf4d.mp4?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive a Harsh World</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each layer brings its own challenges, adapt and descend. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simulated Limb and Cardiovascular Systems</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Injuries are unavoidable. You will have to bandage yourself, fight infected wounds, and stabilize blood loss before losing consciousness. Additionally, your mood can greatly affect your chances of survival, too much doom and gloom will make your life harder. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/b3884ced84ba6d0a433d7dbdf284ab71.poster.avif?t=1782201614\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/b3884ced84ba6d0a433d7dbdf284ab71.webm?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/b3884ced84ba6d0a433d7dbdf284ab71.mp4?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft to Survive</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a creature capable of reason, using tools will allow you to travel the cavernous layers more efficiently. In case you start bleeding out, the flora will provide great resources to patch yourself up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore at Your Own Risk</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Previous expeditions have left some good loot behind. But even helpful things can prove to be your death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What actually lies at the end of this journey? And what becomes of you if you are to succeed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/4fcbd793385f447abfaf27a4750ea84c.poster.avif?t=1782201614\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/4fcbd793385f447abfaf27a4750ea84c.webm?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/4fcbd793385f447abfaf27a4750ea84c.mp4?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An entirely simulated cardiovascular and limb damage system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character traits to increase on your run: Intelligence, Strength, and Resilience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robust crafting mechanics to increase your odds of survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 characters with their own distinct playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 layers of an alien planet with their own challenges and dangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300 items to find on your runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable loot and danger values accessible on the main menu</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
 "short_description": "Casualties: Unknown is an unforgiving cave-exploration survival simulator. Your captors have tasked you with retrieving lost cargo on a foreign planet, explore its 11 layers and do your best to survive diverse hostile environments. You are just one of the thousands of test subjects sent to die.",
